  "id": "sad",
  "term": "SAD",
  "definition": "SAD refers to social anxiety disorder, a clinical condition discussed here in relation to how exercise or structured physical activity might be used alongside established treatments such as cognitive behavioral therapy and medication. In this context, it is the target diagnosis for which direct and indirect evidence about adjunctive exercise is being reviewed.",
